# a new project with every slot full has no slot: GLO's list shows every slot's summary (LK_ACTION rows) and SAVE
# TO on them, and is built every frame; whether a slot holds a project (and its summary) is read from the flash
# once, not every frame (a store read keeps interrupts off a while: the LED scan stalled and the black keys' mid
# level flickered under the list)
wait 300
projsave 1
projsave 2
projsave 3
tap GLO
tap SEL
row NEW PROJECT
tap SEL
wait 100
tap SEL
wait 200
tap GLO
tap SEL
expect listopen 1
wait 1000
expect slot_reads <4
# every slot's summary shown at once: still cached, however long the list stays up
wait 1000
expect slot_reads <4
tap HOME
